Task: Tests de la decisión de refresco, en `Engine` (Fase 7, pattern-copy_20260910)

Red phase. Six cases for `PatternPasteRefresh(destination:loaded:armed:)`:
pasting into the loaded slot refreshes the live copy, pasting elsewhere does
not, pasting into the armed slot re-arms it, pasting outside the armed slot does
not, a destination that is both loaded and armed does both, and nothing is ever
re-armed when nothing is armed.

Files: Packages/Engine/Tests/EngineTests/PatternPasteRefreshTests.swift (new)

Why: found by the device pass. `Project` does not govern the two copies that
made the paste look dead — `TransportModel.pattern`, the live copy the track
screen edits and `recordEdit()` writes back to the Bank, and the snapshot the
transport already had armed. Deciding which of them a paste has to refresh is a
rule, so it lives where there are tests.
